title: DNS Zone Enumeration and Export via PowerShell
status: experimental
description: Detects PowerShell cmdlets that enumerate or export DNS server zones, which gives an attacker a map of internal hosts. Observed on a child domain controller in the Akira intrusion.
references:
    - https://thedfirreport.com/2026/06/29/from-bing-search-to-ransomware-bumblebee-and-adaptixc2-deliver-akira-3/
author: Sümeyra Yüksel
date: 2026/10/20
tags:
    - attack.discovery
    - attack.t1018
logsource:
    category: ps_script
    product: windows
detection:
    selection:
        ScriptBlockText|contains: 'Export-DnsServerZone'
    condition: selection
fields:
    - ScriptBlockText
    - Path
falsepositives:
    - DNS administrators backing up or migrating zones
level: medium
